[{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Hi, this is Shelley Meyer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm renting your house on Archwood Avenue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm due to move in next week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes... hello, Ms. Meyer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/5.mp3"},{"answer":"What can I do for you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/6.mp3"},{"answer":"When I viewed the house, I told you I'll most probably need to rent some furniture,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/7.mp3"},{"answer":"at least until I know whether my temporary work contract is going to be made permanent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course, I remember.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/9.mp3"},{"answer":"And I said I could give you some information about furniture rental companies in the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/10.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the biggest company is called Peak Rentals.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I've recommended them to other people and have always heard positive reports about them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you give me an idea of their costs?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I actually have one of their brochures here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It says the monthly price per room starts at $105 and goes up to $239.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/17.mp3"},{"answer":"That depends on which rooms you need furniture for, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/19.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just to get a general idea of how much it's going to cost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/20.mp3"},{"answer":"And you said you had some positive feedback about this company?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/22.mp3"},{"answer":"People have mentioned that the furniture from Peak Rentals is more modern than any of the other companies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/23.mp3"},{"answer":"And also, once you place an order, the furniture will be delivered to you in just one or two days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/24.mp3"},{"answer":"That would be really helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and the brochure says that there's a special offer at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/26.mp3"},{"answer":"If you rent living room furniture, I believe that's a set of chairs and a TV table,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/27.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll also get a lamp at no extra cost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, but you know, that price range you gave is more than I was hoping to pay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you could try Aaron and Oliver.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry, what and Oliver?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Aaron.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/32-2025-07-23-10-26-20.mp3"},{"answer":"AARON.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, are they cheaper?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd say they are a mid price company.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/35.mp3"},{"answer":"But if you chose them, you need to be aware that they charge an extra 12% every month in case of damage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd have to do the math carefully then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/39.mp3"},{"answer":"But one helpful thing is that they also do cleaning for customers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/40.mp3"},{"answer":"For the furniture?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/41.mp3"},{"answer":"For the house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I probably won't need that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/44.mp3"},{"answer":"There's another company called Larch Furniture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/45.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite new, and it has the lowest prices in town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/46.mp3"},{"answer":"That's for both furniture and also electronic equipment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that would be good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not bringing much with me, and I won't have much time to go shopping after I start my job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/49.mp3"},{"answer":"There are two things you need to know about Larch Furniture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/50.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all you have to take out insurance on the furniture and you need to organize that yourself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/51.mp3"},{"answer":"That wouldn't be too hard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Also, you can't take out a contract for less than six months","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/53.mp3"},{"answer":"but I figure that might not be a problem for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/54.mp3"},{"answer":"You're renting the house for 12 months after all, aren't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I... Sorry to interrupt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/57.mp3"},{"answer":"I just thought of another furniture rental company.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/58.mp3"},{"answer":"It's called Space Rentals,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/59.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's located very near to the house.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't have any information about their charges,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/62.mp3"},{"answer":"so it's best to use their app to find out what it would cost you to use them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/65.mp3"},{"answer":"One good thing about that company is that if you don't like the furniture once it's delivered, you can request exchanges,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/66.mp3"},{"answer":"as long as you do that within a week of receiving it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/67.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds really great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well, thanks very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/69.mp3"},{"answer":"That's so helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/cam20-test-3-part-1-2025-07-21-19-50-32/70.mp3"}]
